            "sid": "ISA 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avinyumba yu vwami vwa Daudi vaveeye kuli umusaala gumali kotemagwa; navuzwa kuli visivu visivukaa kutura ku kitinya, nindio mwami muhia alasingira kutura hagati hi visukululwi via Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Avandu vaahaminywa valirana",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lidiku lizaa lwu mwami muhia kutura munyumba yu vwami vwa Daudi alava kelolero ku zihiiri ziosi. Valavunga harara mu lidaala lilie liu vwami nukumuha luyali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwa ilidiku yilio liduka, Yahova alakatumikiri zinguru zizie kandi koleta avandu veve yengo, avandu vaatigara mu kivala cha Asiria na Egebeti, kandi muvivala via Panzurosi, Ezopia, Elamu, Babiloni; Hamazi, kandi kutura mu visulu vie inyanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yahova alasingiriza kelolero chebendera ukumanyia zihiiri ndi avungiza avandu veve harara ulwa kaviri, avandu vasalanywa va Isiraeli ni Ivuyuda, na aviiranyiaa kutura mu zikona zine zie lirova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uvwami vwa Isiraeli sivulakendekera uvwami vwi Ivuyuda kandi mba, kandi Ivuyuda silava musigu wa Isiraeli kandi mba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vombi harara vatangilira Avafilisitia ku lovega lwi madioli nukulanya avandu vamenyaa ku lovega lwi Ivugwi. Valaguuta avandu va Edomu na Moabu, kandi avandu va Amoni valavatia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yahova alakaminya amazi mu mukono gwi inyanza ya Egebeti, kandi alaleeta imbuza imbiu kukaminya mugera gwa Efurate. Alagwavukanyia mu togera saba, kunangwa avandu vaduuki kwambuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi halavaho ninzira enene kutura Asiria kigira yavo vandu veve Isiraeli avatigara mwoyo, kuli gaali ku avaguuga vaavo lwa vaatura Egebeti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
